indow's page, and publish it. One at a time: two pages sample the same thread.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:44:53.826Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:44:53.826Z"}
{"id":"fd5baf66-28c5-4466-8ede-076f54fb7414","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"fed2039a7b1305e0","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/preview-profile.ts","baseline":{"blob":"2f5a8f26593d0600e0a3187063ba340ce25a791f","start":3039,"end":3186},"shape":{"type":"Throw","atoms":["throw","new","Error","(","`","the preview's page can't be profiled (","${","String","(","error",")","}","): reload it, so it's served with the profiling policy","`",",","{","\"","cause","\"",":","error","}",")"]},"context":{"before":"c49d74eeff529f8a#0","after":"ccc83bf6a9ccb854"}},"payload":{"text":"Not allowed: the page came before the service worker served its document with the policy.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:44:55.096Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:44:55.096Z"}
